<title>USA: U.S. Sept S&amp;P 500s rally to record highs.</title>
<headline>U.S. Sept S&amp;P 500s rally to record highs.</headline>
<text>
<p>June 12 - U.S. September S&amp;P 500 futures rallied to record highs on active dealer buying. One floor source described activity as &quot;panic buying.&quot; Sept touched off buy-stops after running through resistance at 891.00, he said. Sept rose to 892.70.</p>
